The repository structure may use directories to support the workflow, but directory names alone must not be the sole source of truth for semantic lifecycle state.

## Asset manifest
Introduce a versioned manifest/schema capable of representing where relevant:
- presentation-domain asset ID;
- asset family/category;
- lifecycle state;
- source files and derived game-ready files;
- provenance/generator/manual origin;
- license/attribution requirements;
- semantic tags/presentation roles;
