## Source/derived separation
The architecture must distinguish editable/regenerable production sources from engine-ready derived assets.

Examples:
- Blender source/script + exported GLB;
- concept/reference image + generated mesh + corrected source + final export;
- reusable texture/material source + imported Godot resources.

Derived output may be recreated without changing gameplay/world identity.

## Regenerable Blender assets
