- root + nested `AGENTS.md`;
- conflicting nested scopes;
- `CLAUDE.md`, доступный только одному provider по умолчанию;
- instruction changed/deleted mid-review;
- symlink/traversal;
- same repo in two canonical roots;
- provider default auto-context enabled/disabled;
- secret-bearing local file;
- unsupported file is reported, not silently applied.

